  "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>變調注意事項：</strong>先顯示詞彙本調（pr.），再顯示其變調（pt.，亦是歌詞中出現的形式）。<br><strong>Tone Sandhi Note:</strong> the pre-sandhi tone (pr.) is displayed first, followed by the post-sandhi tone (pt., also how it appears in the lyrics).</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">歡喜就好 활<ruby style=\"position: relative\">히<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 8px\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">둏<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 8px\">ˬ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">호<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 8px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">第一段 First paragraph</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>좐쟝웨 (Hokkien)</strong></td><td><strong>中文</strong></td><td><strong>English</strong></td></tr><tr><td>찐솅<ruby style=\"position: relative\">해<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">해<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>人生如此</td><td>c&#8217;est la vie</td></tr><tr><td>감수<ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄋᆤ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby></td><td>豈需要</td><td>is there a need</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">렁<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby>ᄅᆤ<ruby style=\"position: relative\">개<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>都了解</td><td>to understand it all</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">우<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby>시<ruby style=\"position: relative\">아 (pr.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby><br><ruby style=\"position: relative\">우<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby>시<ruby style=\"position: relative\">아 (pt.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby></td><td>有時候</td><td>sometimes</td></tr><tr><td>촁<ruby style=\"position: relative\">첼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>清醒</td><td>clear-headed</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">우<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">시 (pr.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˏ</rt></ruby><br><ruby style=\"position: relative\">우<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby>시 (pt.)</td><td>有時</td><td>sometimes</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">친<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">채<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>隨便</td><td>whatever</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">우<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">랑<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˏ</rt></ruby></td><td>有人</td><td>there are people</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">겅<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">호<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>說好（說是好的）</td><td>say it&#8217;s good</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">읻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뎽<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby></td><td>一定</td><td>surely</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">겅<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">빼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>說壞（說是壞的）</td><td>say it&#8217;s bad</td></tr><tr><td>나 (pr.)<br><ruby style=\"position: relative\">나 (pt.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby></td><td>若</td><td>if</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">매<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby>슐 (pr.)<br><ruby style=\"position: relative\">매<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">슐 (pt.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby></td><td>不要想</td><td>don&#8217;t think</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">햫<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby>죄</td><td>那麼多</td><td>that much</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>我們（<em>包括聽者</em>）</td><td>our (<em>inclusive of the listener</em>)</td></tr><tr><td>솅<ruby style=\"position: relative\">왛 (pr.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˍ</rt></ruby><br>솅<ruby style=\"position: relative\">왛 (pt.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby></td><td>生活</td><td>lives (<em>noun</em>)</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">캏 (pr.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby><br><ruby style=\"position: relative\">캏 (pt.)<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td><td>比較</td><td>comparatively</td></tr><tr><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">주<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 5px\">ˬ</rt></ruby>재</td><td>自在</td><td>carefree</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
}
